## Accessibility Guidelines

### Mobile Accessibility
- **Screen Reader Support**: Use proper ARIA labels and roles
- **Keyboard Navigation**: Ensure all interactive elements are keyboard accessible
- **Focus Management**: Visible focus indicators for touch and keyboard users
- **Color Contrast**: Maintain WCAG AA contrast ratios
- **Text Scaling**: Support system font size preferences

### Touch Accessibility
- **Touch Targets**: Minimum 44px touch targets
- **Gesture Alternatives**: Provide alternative ways to access functionality
- **Orientation Support**: Support both portrait and landscape orientations
- **Zoom Support**: Ensure content remains usable when zoomed

## Performance Considerations

### Mobile Performance
- **Bundle Size**: Keep JavaScript bundles small for mobile networks
- **Lazy Loading**: Use React.lazy() for code splitting
- **Image Optimization**: Use responsive images with proper srcset
- **Touch Events**: Optimize touch event handling
- **Memory Management**: Clean up event listeners and subscriptions

### Responsive Images
```tsx
<img
  src="/image-mobile.jpg"
  srcSet="/image-mobile.jpg 640w, /image-desktop.jpg 1024w"
  sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw"
